[00:40.57] Beating
[00:44.94] Heart still beating for the cause
[00:50.39] Feeding
[00:54.89] Soul still feeding on the loss
[01:00.53] Aching
[01:04.80] Limbs are aching from the rush
[01:10.66] Fading
[01:15.19] You are fading from my sight
[01:21.47] Break of morning, coldness lingers on
[01:31.39] Shroud me into nightmares of the sun
[01:42.22] 
[02:01.14] Moving
[02:05.50] I am moving closer to your side
[02:11.31] Luring
[02:15.99] You are luring me into the night
[02:21.31] Crying
[02:25.82] Who is crying for you here
[02:31.40] Dying
[02:36.13] I am dying fast inside your tears
[02:40.84] 
[02:49.85] Plunging towards bereavement faster yet
[02:59.80] Clearing thoughts, my mind is set
[03:09.23] 
[03:25.32] Devious movements in your eyes
[03:30.82] Moved me from relief
[03:35.15] Breath comes out white clouds with your lies
[03:41.02] And filters through me
[03:44.96] You're close to the final word
[03:49.90] You're staring right past me in dismay
[03:55.19] A liquid seeps from your chest
[04:01.15] And drains me away
[04:05.68] Mist ripples round your thin white neck
[04:11.39] And draws me a line
[04:15.75] Cold fingers mark this dying wreck
[04:21.54] This moment is mine
[04:27.80] 
[05:41.04] Help me cure you
[05:47.04] Atone for all you've done
[05:51.34] Help me leave you
[05:57.08] As all the days are done
[06:02.86] 
[08:19.24] Night falls again
[08:21.71] Taking what's left of me
[08:24.07] Slight twist, shivering corpse
[08:28.72] Ornated with water, fills the cracks
[08:33.93] Clasped in my limbs by tradition
[08:38.84] This is all you need
[08:49.86] 